cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SHAARP.py
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the two ♯SHAARP papers below (the
  original packages this port reproduces).
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/Rui-Zu/SHAARP.py
abstract: >-
  A validated Python port of the Mathematica ♯SHAARP.si (single-interface
  reflected second-harmonic generation) and ♯SHAARP.ml (multilayer /
  Maker-fringe SHG) packages, merged into one scriptable library and one
  installation-free desktop application. Every solver is validated
  value-by-value against live Mathematica ♯SHAARP output.
keywords:
  - second harmonic generation
  - nonlinear optics
  - anisotropic crystals
  - Maker fringes
  - polarimetry
  - ferroelectrics
authors:
  - family-names: Zu
    given-names: Rui
    affiliation: The Pennsylvania State University
